    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2562\"><em data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2562\">(10th Level)</em></p><p data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2624\">When you successfully banish, dispel, or suppress an effect:</p><p data-start=\"2626\" data-end=\"2704\">You may spend <strong data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2670\">1 additional Surge</strong> to apply <strong data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2703\">Persistent Deletion</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2713\">Effect:</p><ul data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2826\"><li data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2791\"><p data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2791\">The same effect cannot be reapplied to that target for 1 minute,<br data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"2783\" /><strong data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2791\">or</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2826\"><p data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2826\">It returns weakened (GM choice).</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2870\">If this contradicts established Precedent:</p><p data-start=\"2872\" data-end=\"2898\">Gain +1 additional misfire risk.</p><p data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2922\">Deletion is tolerated.</p><p data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2951\">Contradicting canon is not.</p><p><em>Recosted 2026-08-23: this ability's earlier economy (Civic Charge / Strain / Resonance / Leverage / Administrative Pressure) is retired \u2014 everything now runs on Surge, Clarity, Noise, and the misfire ladder. The ability dialog's cost line is the truth; ledgers named here are narrative, GM-adjudicated, never a tracked pool.</em></p>",
